'''Pablo''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Scarleton}}, on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Quest ==
'''Pablo''' will ask the player for a certain Flower to make Dyes. Once the player gives the specific Flower to Pablo, the player will gain {{Reputation|Mage|25}}.

;Flowers
*{{Item|Enchanted Dandelion}}: {{Green|45%}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Poppy}}: {{Green|45%}}
*{{Item|End Stone Rose}}: {{Green|10%}}

The quest can be completed once every {{Green|2 days}}.

